UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>Plenty of gifts are more practical than flowers. Few say as much. A bouquet tells someone you thought about them today, and it arrives ready to enjoy with nothing to assemble, charge or return.</p>
<h2>Why flowers land so well</h2>
<ul><li><strong>They arrive as a moment.</strong> A delivery at the door or office is an event, and the person feels it immediately.</li><li><strong>They stay in view.</strong> A bouquet on the table is a reminder for days after it arrives.</li><li><strong>They suit almost any relationship.</strong> You can send flowers to a partner, mother, colleague or client by changing the colour and size.</li></ul>
<h2>What colours tend to say</h2>
<p><a href="/red-roses-nairobi">Red roses</a> are the classic message of love. <a href="/pink-roses-nairobi">Pink roses</a> feel softer, suiting admiration and thanks. <a href="/white-roses-nairobi">White roses</a> are often chosen for weddings and sympathy. Yellow flowers bring cheer, which makes them a good choice for birthdays and get-well wishes. For more detail, read <a href="/blog/rose-colors-meaning-anniversaries">what rose colours mean</a>.</p>
<h2>How to make a bouquet feel personal</h2>
<ol><li>Pick for the person, not the price. A favourite colour counts for more than extra stems.</li><li>Write a short message in your own words. Two honest sentences are enough.</li><li>Add one small extra, like chocolate or a <a href="/teddy-bears-nairobi">teddy bear</a>, if it fits them.</li></ol>
<p>Our <a href="/blog/what-flowers-to-send-occasion-kenya">occasion guide</a> covers what to send and when, and our <a href="/blog/flower-prices-nairobi">price guide</a> shows what each budget buys. When you are ready, <a href="/collections/flowers">browse our bouquets</a> and order by 4PM for same-day delivery across Nairobi.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$Why flowers still beat most gifts, what different colours say, and how to choose a bouquet that feels personal in Nairobi.$x$, meta_title = $x$Why Flowers Are Still the Most Meaningful Gift$x$, meta_description = $x$Why flowers still beat most gifts, what different colours say, and how to choose a bouquet that feels personal in Nairobi.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$meaningful gifts flowers$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$why-flowers-are-still-the-most-meaningful-gifts-today$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>Our shop is in the CBD, at Delta Hotel Building on University Way, so offices, hotels and hospitals in town are the easiest deliveries we make. Here is how to get flowers there today.</p>
<h2>The short version</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Cut-off:</strong> order by 4PM for same-day delivery.</li><li><strong>Delivery fee:</strong> free within Nairobi CBD.</li><li><strong>Payment:</strong> M-Pesa or card online, or cash in the shop.</li><li><strong>Shop hours:</strong> Monday to Saturday, 8AM to 8PM.</li></ul>
<h2>What to tell us for a smooth CBD delivery</h2>
<p>CBD buildings can be hard to access, so details matter:</p>
<ol><li>The building name, floor and office or room number</li><li>The recipient's phone number, in case reception needs them to come down</li><li>Whether the delivery should be a surprise</li><li>Any time limit, such as before a meeting or a lunch break</li></ol>
<h2>Prefer to collect it yourself?</h2>
<p>If you work nearby, you can walk in to choose flowers or collect an order on your way to dinner. See our <a href="/florist-nairobi-cbd">Nairobi CBD florist page</a> for location details.</p>
<h2>Delivering outside town?</h2>
<p>We also deliver same day across the city. Fees are KSh 200 to Upper Hill, KSh 300 to Westlands and Kilimani, KSh 400 to Lavington and KSh 600 to Karen. Read <a href="/blog/flower-delivery-nairobi">how delivery works in Nairobi</a> or go straight to our <a href="/same-day-flower-delivery-nairobi">same-day delivery page</a>. Running late? Our <a href="/blog/last-minute-same-day-flower-gifts-nairobi">last-minute gift guide</a> can help.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$How same-day flower delivery works in Nairobi CBD: the 4PM cut-off, free CBD delivery, what details to share and walk-in options at University Way.$x$, meta_title = $x$Same Day Flower Delivery in Nairobi CBD$x$, meta_description = $x$How same-day flower delivery works in Nairobi CBD: the 4PM cut-off, free CBD delivery, what details to share and walk-in options at University Way.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$same day flower delivery Nairobi CBD$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$same-day-flower-delivery-nairobi-cbd$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>A good corporate gift should feel generous without being personal, and it needs to reach the right desk on time. These pointers help you choose hampers for clients, staff and partners in Nairobi.</p>
<h2>Match the hamper to the relationship</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Key clients and partners:</strong> a larger <a href="/corporate-gift-hampers-nairobi">corporate hamper</a> that feels like a proper thank-you.</li><li><strong>Teams and staff:</strong> smaller, consistent gifts so that everyone receives the same thing.</li><li><strong>A new office or promotion:</strong> <a href="/corporate-flowers-nairobi">corporate flowers</a> that brighten the reception or desk.</li></ul>
<h2>Budget guide</h2>
<p>Our <a href="/collections/gift-hampers">gift hampers</a> start from KSh 8,500. For larger groups on a tighter budget, a box of <a href="/collections/chocolates">Ferrero Rocher</a> from KSh 1,500 or a <a href="/collections/wines">bottle of wine</a> from KSh 3,500 with a card works well.</p>
<h2>Things to check first</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Alcohol:</strong> some recipients don't drink, and some companies restrict it. <a href="/blog/non-alcoholic-wines-gift-hampers-guide">Non-alcoholic wine</a> is a safe swap.</li><li><strong>Gift policies:</strong> some organisations limit what staff can accept.</li><li><strong>Delivery list:</strong> gather names, phone numbers, buildings and floors before ordering.</li><li><strong>Branding:</strong> ask us about adding your message or company card.</li></ol>
<h2>Ordering in bulk</h2>
<p>Send us your quantity, budget, delivery date and list of locations on WhatsApp, and we will confirm what is possible. Booking early matters most around year-end, when many companies send gifts in the same week. See also <a href="/blog/best-gifts-for-colleagues-nairobi">gifts for colleagues</a>.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$How to choose corporate gift hampers in Nairobi: budgets, what suits clients and staff, alcohol-free options, and how to arrange bulk delivery.$x$, meta_title = $x$Best Gift Hampers for Corporate Gifting in Nairobi$x$, meta_description = $x$How to choose corporate gift hampers in Nairobi: budgets, what suits clients and staff, alcohol-free options, and how to arrange bulk delivery.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$corporate gift hampers Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$best-gift-hampers-for-corporate-gifting-nairobi$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>Teddy bears work for almost any age, but size changes the message completely. Here is how to choose the right one from our <a href="/collections/teddy-bears">teddy bear collection</a>.</p>
<h2>Which size suits which occasion</h2>
<ul><li><strong>25cm (from KSh 3,500):</strong> a small add-on to a bouquet, or a gift for a young child.</li><li><strong>50cm (KSh 4,500):</strong> an all-rounder for birthdays and graduations.</li><li><strong>100cm (KSh 8,500):</strong> a real surprise for a partner.</li><li><strong>120cm (KSh 12,500):</strong> comes with a customized Stanley mug, so it feels more personal.</li><li><strong>160cm to 200cm (KSh 15,500 to KSh 19,500):</strong> giant bears for big romantic gestures.</li></ul>
<h2>Before you buy a giant bear</h2>
<p>Big bears are memorable, but think about where they will go. A 200cm bear is hard to take on a matatu and takes up real space at home. If it is going to an office or a small flat, 50cm to 100cm is often the better choice.</p>
<h2>Colours</h2>
<p>Our bears come in brown, white, red, pink and blue. Red and pink suit romance, while brown and white are safe for anyone.</p>
<h2>Bears with flowers</h2>
<p>A teddy with a bouquet is a classic gift pairing. You can add one to any <a href="/collections/flowers">bouquet</a> or choose a ready-made <a href="/gift-hampers-nairobi">hamper</a> such as the Sweetheart Snuggler, which has a 50cm bear, flowers, Ferrero Rocher and a bracelet. Order by 4PM for same-day delivery. Buying for a child? Read <a href="/blog/best-gifts-for-children-nairobi">best gifts for children</a>.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$A practical guide to choosing a teddy bear in Nairobi, from 25cm to 200cm: which size suits which occasion, colours, prices and flower combos.$x$, meta_title = $x$Teddy Bears: Choosing the Right Size and Gift$x$, meta_description = $x$A practical guide to choosing a teddy bear in Nairobi, from 25cm to 200cm: which size suits which occasion, colours, prices and flower combos.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$teddy bears Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$teddy-bears-perfect-gifts-for-every-occasion$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>The best gift for your wife shows you noticed something about her, and a little planning does more than a bigger budget. Here are ideas that work in Nairobi, and how to pull off the surprise.</p>
<h2>Gift ideas by budget</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Around KSh 3,000 to 5,500:</strong> a <a href="/red-roses-nairobi">rose bouquet</a> with chocolate. Pure Serenity pairs roses and chrysanthemums with Ferrero Rocher.</li><li><strong>Around KSh 8,500 to 12,500:</strong> a <a href="/gift-hampers-nairobi">gift hamper</a> or a large teddy bear with flowers.</li><li><strong>KSh 14,500 and up:</strong> a bigger hamper. GentlePaw includes a 100cm teddy, flowers, non-alcoholic wine, Ferrero Rocher, a necklace, a bracelet and a watch.</li></ul>
<h2>How to plan a surprise delivery</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Pick the place.</strong> The office makes a public moment, while home feels more private. Choose what she would enjoy.</li><li><strong>Check she'll be there.</strong> Quietly confirm her schedule so the delivery doesn't miss her.</li><li><strong>Give the rider a contact.</strong> A colleague or the house help can receive it without spoiling the surprise.</li><li><strong>Order by 4PM</strong> for same-day delivery, or earlier for a morning arrival.</li></ol>
<h2>What to write on the card</h2>
<p>Skip the generic lines. Mention something specific: a thing she did this week, what you appreciate, or a plan for tonight. For example: "You've carried so much this month. Dinner is on me tonight."</p>
<h2>Saying sorry instead?</h2>
<p>Different occasion, different flowers. Read our guide to <a href="/blog/apology-flowers-nairobi-how-to-say-sorry">apology flowers</a>. For anniversaries, see <a href="/anniversary-flowers-nairobi">anniversary flowers</a> and <a href="/blog/how-many-roses-to-send-nairobi">how many roses to send</a>.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$Gift and surprise ideas for your wife in Nairobi: flowers, hampers and teddies by budget, how to plan a delivery surprise, and what to write on the card.$x$, meta_title = $x$Best Gifts for Wives in Nairobi: Surprise Ideas That Work$x$, meta_description = $x$Gift and surprise ideas for your wife in Nairobi: flowers, hampers and teddies by budget, how to plan a delivery surprise, and what to write on the card.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$gifts for wife Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$best-gifts-for-wives-nairobi$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>A money bouquet combines cash and flowers into one gift. It is popular for graduations, birthdays and weddings because it looks special in photos and gives the person something they can really use.</p>
<h2>When a money bouquet works well</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Graduations:</strong> a practical reward, and it looks great at the ceremony.</li><li><strong>Milestone birthdays:</strong> especially when you don't know what someone wants.</li><li><strong>Weddings and new homes:</strong> cash is often the most useful gift.</li></ul>
<h2>Planning one</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Decide the total budget.</strong> Remember it has two parts: the amount of cash, and the bouquet and arrangement around it.</li><li><strong>Choose how the notes should look.</strong> Crisp, new notes look best, so get them early.</li><li><strong>Talk to us first.</strong> Message us on WhatsApp with your budget, amount and date so that we can confirm options and timing.</li></ol>
<h2>Delivery and safety</h2>
<p>Because this gift holds real cash, hand-collection or a planned handover is often the most sensible option. Confirm on WhatsApp how you want it handled, and make sure the recipient is available at the agreed time.</p>
<h2>Prefer a no-cash option?</h2>
<p>A <a href="/collections/flowers">bouquet</a> with a card, plus an M-Pesa transfer you send on the day, gives a similar result with no cash in transit. Or consider a <a href="/graduation-bouquets-nairobi">graduation bouquet</a> or <a href="/gift-hampers-nairobi">gift hamper</a>. Not sure what to spend? See our <a href="/blog/flower-prices-nairobi">price guide</a>.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$What a money bouquet is, when it works as a gift in Nairobi, how to plan the amount, and safe delivery tips for a flowers-and-cash surprise.$x$, meta_title = $x$Money Bouquet Nairobi: How It Works and When to Give One$x$, meta_description = $x$What a money bouquet is, when it works as a gift in Nairobi, how to plan the amount, and safe delivery tips for a flowers-and-cash surprise.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$money bouquet Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$money-bouquet-nairobi$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>A work gift should feel warm but stay professional. These ideas suit common office occasions in Nairobi, whether you are buying alone or the team is contributing.</p>
<h2>Ideas by occasion</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Birthday:</strong> a cheerful <a href="/mixed-bouquets-nairobi">mixed bouquet</a>, or an 8-piece box of <a href="/collections/chocolates">Ferrero Rocher</a> from KSh 1,500.</li><li><strong>Promotion:</strong> a <a href="/collections/wines">bottle of sparkling wine</a> with a <a href="/collections/cards">congratulations card</a>, if they drink.</li><li><strong>Farewell:</strong> a <a href="/collections/gift-hampers">gift hamper</a> from the whole team, from KSh 8,500.</li><li><strong>Maternity or illness:</strong> <a href="/get-well-soon-flowers-nairobi">soft flowers</a> or a <a href="/fruit-baskets-nairobi">fruit basket</a>.</li></ul>
<h2>Keeping it appropriate</h2>
<p>Avoid anything too romantic. Red roses and giant teddy bears send the wrong message at work. Choose mixed colours, and go for non-alcoholic options unless you know the person drinks.</p>
<h2>Buying as a team</h2>
<p>Collect contributions over M-Pesa, nominate one person to place the order, and have everyone sign one card. A shared hamper usually feels better than several small gifts.</p>
<h2>Delivering to the office</h2>
<p>Give us the building, floor and a contact at reception, and say if it is a surprise. Delivery is free within Nairobi CBD and KSh 200 to Upper Hill. Order by 4PM for same-day delivery. Buying for clients? See our <a href="/blog/best-gift-hampers-for-corporate-gifting-nairobi">corporate hamper guide</a>.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$Gift ideas for colleagues in Nairobi by occasion and budget: farewells, promotions, birthdays and team gifts, plus tips for office delivery.$x$, meta_title = $x$Best Gifts for Colleagues in Nairobi$x$, meta_description = $x$Gift ideas for colleagues in Nairobi by occasion and budget: farewells, promotions, birthdays and team gifts, plus tips for office delivery.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$gifts for colleagues Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$best-gifts-for-colleagues-nairobi$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>The hard part of buying for a couple is finding something that suits both people. The easy answer is something they can share. Here are ideas for the usual occasions.</p>
<h2>Ideas by occasion</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Wedding:</strong> a <a href="/collections/gift-hampers">gift hamper</a> delivered before or after the day, since they will be busy on the day itself.</li><li><strong>Anniversary:</strong> <a href="/flower-wine-hamper-nairobi">flowers with wine</a> for a ready-made evening at home.</li><li><strong>New home:</strong> a <a href="/flower-boxes-nairobi">flower box</a> for the new table, with a bottle to toast the move.</li><li><strong>Engagement:</strong> <a href="/collections/wines">sparkling wine</a> with a <a href="/collections/cards">congratulations card</a>.</li></ul>
<h2>Choosing well</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Pick something shareable.</strong> Wine, chocolates and hampers work for two.</li><li><strong>Check whether they drink.</strong> If you are unsure, ask for <a href="/blog/non-alcoholic-wines-gift-hampers-guide">non-alcoholic wine</a>.</li><li><strong>Think about timing.</strong> Flowers fade, so avoid sending them just before a couple travels.</li></ol>
<h2>Budget guide</h2>
<p>A bottle of wine starts from KSh 3,500, and a box of Ferrero Rocher from KSh 1,500. Hampers start from KSh 8,500. Add a card from KSh 250.</p>
<p>Order by 4PM for same-day delivery across Nairobi. Planning a wedding yourself? See <a href="/wedding-flowers-nairobi">wedding flowers</a> and our guide to <a href="/blog/wedding-flowers-nairobi-the-stems">wedding flowers on a budget</a>.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$Gift ideas for couples in Nairobi: weddings, anniversaries, new homes and engagements, with hampers, wine and flowers they can enjoy together.$x$, meta_title = $x$Best Gifts for Couples in Nairobi$x$, meta_description = $x$Gift ideas for couples in Nairobi: weddings, anniversaries, new homes and engagements, with hampers, wine and flowers they can enjoy together.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$gifts for couples Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$best-gifts-for-couples-nairobi$x$;

UPDATE blog_posts SET content = $x$<p>Children respond to gifts they can hold, hug and show off. These ideas work for birthdays, school graduations and visits, with advice on choosing for each age.</p>
<h2>Ideas by age</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Toddlers:</strong> a 25cm <a href="/collections/teddy-bears">teddy bear</a>, small enough for little arms. Check for small parts that could come loose.</li><li><strong>PP2 and early primary:</strong> a 50cm teddy or a small, bright <a href="/graduation-bouquets-nairobi">graduation bouquet</a> for photos.</li><li><strong>Older primary:</strong> a bouquet with chocolates feels more grown up. Ask what they actually like.</li><li><strong>Teenagers:</strong> sweets, flowers in a favourite colour, or a card with a personal note.</li></ul>
<h2>Choosing a teddy size</h2>
<p>A 25cm bear costs from KSh 3,500 and a 50cm costs KSh 4,500. A 100cm bear at KSh 8,500 can be bigger than the child, which many kids love, but check that there is room at home. Read more in our <a href="/blog/teddy-bears-perfect-gifts-for-every-occasion">teddy bear guide</a>.</p>
<h2>A few things parents will thank you for</h2>
<ol><li>Check for allergies before sending chocolates.</li><li>Ask before sending a very large gift to a small home.</li><li>Include a short card with your name, so that the parents know who to thank.</li></ol>
<h2>Graduation day</h2>
<p>School ceremonies start early, so order ahead and share the school name and a contact number. See our <a href="/blog/graduation-and-kids-gifts-nairobi">graduation and kids gifts guide</a>. On other days, order by 4PM for same-day delivery across Nairobi.</p>$x$,
  excerpt = $x$Gift ideas for children in Nairobi by age: teddy bears, graduation bouquets and sweet treats, with size and safety tips for parents and relatives.$x$, meta_title = $x$Best Gifts for Children in Nairobi$x$, meta_description = $x$Gift ideas for children in Nairobi by age: teddy bears, graduation bouquets and sweet treats, with size and safety tips for parents and relatives.$x$, focus_keyword = $x$gifts for children Nairobi$x$,
  read_time = 2, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE slug = $x$best-gifts-for-children-nairobi$x$;

